sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant V as BookingPage (View)
    participant C as BookingController (Controller)
    participant S as AuthService (Service)
    participant B as Backend API (Server)

    %% Scenario 1: Confirming Room Booking
    Note over U, B: Scenario 1: Room Booking Flow (Success & Error validation)

    U->>V: Taps "Verify Phone / Confirm Booking"
    V->>C: confirmReservation()
    
    %% Step 1: Check validation
    C->>C: Verify selection & token
    alt Missing token or invalid selections
        C-->>V: Show Validation Snack (AuthSnackbar)
    else Valid local state
        C->>V: Show Booking Dialog (Confirm Reservation?)
        U->>V: Confirms booking Dialog
        V->>C: _sendReservation(typeId, date, startTime, endTime, token)
        C->>V: Show Loading Spinner (CircularProgressIndicator)
        
        C->>S: POST /bookings (network request)
        S->>B: HTTP POST request with Bearer token
        
        alt API Success (200 / 201 Created)
            B-->>S: HTTP 200/201 (JSON payload)
            S-->>C: Map: { success: true, message: 'Reservation confirmed!' }
            C-->>V: Dismiss loading spinner
            C-->>V: Show Success Snack ("Reservation confirmed!")
            C->>C: _clearSelections()
            C->>C: fetchOccupiedDates() (Refresh Calendar)
        else API Failure: Phone Not Verified (400/403)
            B-->>S: HTTP 400/403 {"detail": "Veuillez vérifier votre numéro de téléphone..."}
            S-->>C: Map: { success: false, statusCode: 403, message: '...' }
            C-->>V: Dismiss loading spinner
            C->>C: Intercept & translate French message to English
            C-->>V: Show Error Snack ("Please verify your phone number in settings...")
        else API Failure: General Error (500/Timeout)
            B-->>S: HTTP Status/Timeout Exception
            S-->>C: Map: { success: false, message: 'Connection error' }
            C-->>V: Dismiss loading spinner
            C-->>V: Show Error Snack ("Connection error")
        end
    end
